LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 2031 Sansom Street\, Philadelphia
DESCRIPTION:Ray Lau is a Cantonese American standup comedian. His style has
  been praised by audiences for being unique\, relatable\, lighthearted\, an
 d playful. Ray’s most viral joke is about the “Chipotle Bean Scheme” 
 and has been seen millions of times. You can often see him performing live 
 across Southern California on the stages of Don’t Tell Comedy\, The Holly
 wood Improv\, Flappers\, and many more. His debut on the digital platform D
 on’t Tell Comedy premieres this Summer.\n\nCouples Package includes:\n\n-
  2 premium seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit ($45 per person)\n- Gratuity
 \n- Ticket Protection\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent customers
